---
// Deploy.astro — What ships today + what's on the roadmap (compact, honest)
---

<section id="deploy" class="section-pad-compact deploy-section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="section-eyebrow" data-reveal>SHIPPING IN 0.5.0</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
      Locally first. Your cloud next.
    </h2>
    <p class="deploy-lede" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
      Kitaru runs today on your laptop or a self-hosted server, with the dashboard, replay, and memory surfaces all available out of the box. Multi-stack cloud deploy is on the roadmap.
    </p>

    <div class="deploy-grid" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">

      <!-- Left: CLI terminal -->
      <div class="deploy-terminal">
        <div class="deploy-terminal-header">
          <div class="deploy-terminal-dots">
            <span class="code-dot"></span>
            <span class="code-dot"></span>
            <span class="code-dot"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="deploy-terminal-title">~/your-agent</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="deploy-terminal-pre"><code><span class="deploy-cmt"># install and log in to a local server</span>
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> uv pip install <span class="deploy-str">"kitaru[local]"</span>
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> kitaru login
<span class="deploy-ok">✓ Connected to local server at http://localhost:9090</span>

<span class="deploy-cmt"># initialize and run your first flow</span>
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> kitaru init
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> python agent.py
<span class="deploy-ok">✓ execution 4f2a complete — 6 checkpoints persisted</span>

<span class="deploy-cmt"># replay from any checkpoint</span>
<span class="deploy-prompt">$</span> kitaru executions replay 4f2a --from process_data
<span class="deploy-ok">✓ replayed from checkpoint process_data</span></code></pre>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: available today checklist -->
      <div class="deploy-today">
        <div class="deploy-today-head">
          <span class="deploy-today-label">Available today</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="deploy-checklist">
          <li>
            <span class="deploy-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong>Local server + dashboard</strong> with zero config</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="deploy-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong>Checkpointed execution</strong> + CLI replay</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="deploy-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong>Human-in-the-loop waits</strong> via <code>kitaru.wait()</code></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="deploy-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong>Durable memory</strong> across Python, CLI, MCP</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="deploy-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong>PydanticAI adapter</strong> &mdash; wrap any agent with <code>KitaruAgent</code></span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="deploy-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span><strong>Self-host the server</strong> &mdash; <code>kitaru login &lt;url&gt;</code></span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="deploy-roadmap">
          <span class="deploy-roadmap-label">On the roadmap</span>
          <ul class="deploy-roadmap-list">
            <li>Multi-stack cloud deploy (AWS, GCP, Azure)</li>
            <li>OpenAI Agents SDK &amp; Anthropic Agent SDK adapters</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/roadmap" class="deploy-roadmap-link">See the full roadmap <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .deploy-section {
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .deploy-lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.08rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .deploy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  /* ─── Terminal ─── */
  .deploy-terminal {
    background: oklch(0.16 0.015 60);
    border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .deploy-terminal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.06);
  }

  .deploy-terminal-dots {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .deploy-terminal-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: oklch(1 0 0 / 0.4);
  }

  .deploy-terminal-pre {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin: 0;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-dark-text);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .deploy-prompt {
    color: oklch(0.72 0.14 55);
    user-select: none;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .deploy-cmt {
    color: oklch(0.6 0.015 60);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .deploy-str {
    color: oklch(0.78 0.1 155);
  }

  .deploy-ok {
    color: oklch(0.7 0.12 155);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  /* ─── Today + Roadmap ─── */
  .deploy-today {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .deploy-today-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .deploy-today-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .deploy-checklist {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .deploy-checklist li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .deploy-checklist strong {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .deploy-checklist code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    background: oklch(0.65 0.16 45 / 0.08);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .deploy-check {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: oklch(0.55 0.1 155 / 0.12);
    color: var(--color-success);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* Roadmap footer */
  .deploy-roadmap {
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-border);
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-list li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    padding-left: 18px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-list li::before {
    content: '◯';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.75em;
    top: 3px;
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: gap 0.2s;
  }

  .deploy-roadmap-link:hover {
    gap: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .deploy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .deploy-terminal-pre {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }
    .deploy-today {
      padding: 18px 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
